OL,3,GNEWSAWomen deny causing malicious
OL,4,Adamage at Edinburgh defence factory
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree women have denied causing
OL,7,Fmalicious damage to a defence company
OL,8,Fin Edinburgh after a van was driven
OL,9,Finto a wall and paint was sprayed at
OL,10,Fwindows.
OL,12,FNaomi Stubbs-Gorman, 33, Susan Riddell,
OL,13,F43, and Allegra Fitzherbert, 35, are
OL,14,Faccused of driving a van into the
OL,15,Fperimeter fence of the Leonardo UK
OL,16,Ffactory on Crewe Road North on 15 July
OL,17,Flast year.
OL,19,FThey are also accused of spraying paint
OL,20,Fand striking windows on the factory's
OL,21,Fgatehouse as well as cutting the
OL,22,Fperimeter fence with a power tool.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
