OL,3,GNEWSAWomen deny causing malicious
OL,4,Adamage at Edinburgh defence factory
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll three pleaded not guilty and their
OL,7,Fbail was continued. A trial date was
OL,8,Ffixed for 17 May next year.
